  "contract_boundaries": [
    "Sup-only v1; event-investigation and associated-patient processing are separate current purposes, absent by default; patientless events do not invent patient/encounter.",
    "Current Event patient must match Original/Case captured patient before private TEXT; a newly granted current-patient purpose does not authorize an Original bound to a different patient.",
    "Full Event, all same-event legacy RCA and all declared Original statuses remain in the finite Case; published privacy/faithfulness/provenance reviewed human derivatives alone enter released model text.",
    "Old report/create clocks retain stored_naive_no_timezone, raw signed workflow states and independent human occurrence statements; no causal approval, fault finding, clinical recommendation or efficacy proof follows.",
    "Exact UTF8 text, Unicode codepoint spans, per-Case opaque HMAC IDs, complete original/hash/governance and exact AuditPK anchors; no truncation or winner selection.",
    "4MiB Original; private Case and separate public Source and each complete response wrapper each have whole 8MiB limits. A combined wrapper or provider wire is not promised to fit by virtue of these individual limits.",
    "4096 combined closed members/dependencies, 256 released items, 512 human timeline entries, explicit preparse depth32/token200000 limits; whole-refuse on excess.",
    "No global Gate or claim that arbitrary clinical SQL writers serialize. Exactly updateStatus, rca.create and rca.advance use current Actor then Event X; all new legitimate Source writers use the same event parent.",
    "Current directory is short independent READ COMMITTED opaque PK/event union caller same-Session nonlocking opaque PK/event union actual-flush transaction-bound hints; these candidates never grant authority. Main RR remains unchanged; each actual PK is current SHARE verified before body, changed/deleted remnants reject."
  ],
